5.2 Creative users

Creative users may include approved independent creatives, artists, multidisciplinary designers, studios, and specialist teams.

They may participate through:

portfolio discovery and project recommendations;

Ready Interactive Designs;

paid professional customization;

single-service projects; and

multidisciplinary projects or coordinated teams.

5.3 Future users

Salons, wellness services, education, corporate offices, and other creative-service markets are outside the MVP. They may be assessed after the initial model is validated and must not appear as committed MVP sectors.

